  "card": "Fixes an assertion crash loop on startup for nodes using AssumeUTXO that restart while holding the snapshot block before its parent block arrives. On restart, the snapshot block receives a hardcoded chain transaction count and is treated as a candidate tip, causing FindMostWorkChain to walk back into the incomplete parent and fail an assertion on every startup. This PR ensures the snapshot block is registered in m_blocks_unlinked on startup and excluded from tip candidates until its ancestors connect. Without this fix, recovery requires a full reindex that destroys the snapshot chainstate.",
